  "areas": {
    "玻利瓦尔肤层": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background:#3d6335;color:#fff\">Ⅰ 玻利瓦尔肤层</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-1\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/1f/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1.png/105px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1.png?v=fv274wee8sx5wl37s3tstrfguvan4ri\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"105\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1.png?v=fv274wee8sx5wl37s3tstrfguvan4ri 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/a/a6/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1-2.png/113px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1-2.png?v=b07akxoxtswauh69wo35il09d1cjkt0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"113\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_1-2.png?v=b07akxoxtswauh69wo35il09d1cjkt0 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-1\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">uno(I)</span><br />玻利瓦尔肤层<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(I)</span> Superficie</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-1\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>未经探索的土地将自己献与新的主人。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">La tierra ignota se ofrenda a sí misma ante su nuevo dueño.</div>\n<p>初始行动力：5；点亮【生命游戏】的“翅膀”节点后，变为6\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：5；点亮【生命游戏】的“翅膀”节点后，变为6",
      "documented_base_ap": 5
    },
    "甜美的伤口": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background:#1f1147;color:#fff\">Ⅱ 甜美的伤口</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-2\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/a/a7/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2.png/144px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2.png?v=3mhgw7g3l3sjo5ot9agp0zl8mogkzsz\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"144\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2.png?v=3mhgw7g3l3sjo5ot9agp0zl8mogkzsz 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/d/d2/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2-2.png/90px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2-2.png?v=9onc5yda7bo3gbm0e8vmvbjq9fb6i6d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_2-2.png?v=9onc5yda7bo3gbm0e8vmvbjq9fb6i6d 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-2\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">dos(II)</span><br />甜美的伤口<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(II)</span> Carne</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-2\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>刀锋划开，原罪混杂着甘甜倾泻而出。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">Se abre la herida por el filo, y brota el pecado original imbuido en miel.</div>\n<p>初始行动力：6\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：6",
      "documented_base_ap": 6
    },
    "血色空脉": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background:#d1b321;\">Ⅲ 血色空脉</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-3\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/5/56/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3.png/144px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3.png?v=rv7l9tzp8gnnx9becikmqpbafo1n3vp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"144\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3.png?v=rv7l9tzp8gnnx9becikmqpbafo1n3vp 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/c/cc/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3-2.png/81px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3-2.png?v=433mefjyrhsdadf2y65znkf1v9tvz6c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"81\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_3-2.png?v=433mefjyrhsdadf2y65znkf1v9tvz6c 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-3\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">tres(III)</span><br />血色空脉<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(III)</span> Vena</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-3\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>当赤金沐浴阳光的那一刻，整片大地都为之闪烁。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">En el instante en que el oro bermejo se funde con el sol, la tierra entera estalla en un fulgor ciego.</div>\n<p>初始行动力：7\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：7",
      "documented_base_ap": 7
    },
    "受害者腐殖": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background:#79461b;color:#fff\">Ⅳ 受害者腐殖</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-4\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/9/97/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4.png/144px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4.png?v=ncfm0nre5z1mwo3jq2lhb6cqoqp3jws\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"144\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4.png?v=ncfm0nre5z1mwo3jq2lhb6cqoqp3jws 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/9/95/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4-2.png/92px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4-2.png?v=oxryb5hfyextmdkg1r7npvbx0541qhr\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"92\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_4-2.png?v=oxryb5hfyextmdkg1r7npvbx0541qhr 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-4\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">cuatro(IV)</span><br />受害者腐殖<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(IV)</span> Dolor</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-4\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>如果大地不能缓和您的愤怒，就请拿走我的血与骨。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">\"Si la tierra no puede aplacar tu ira, llévate entonces mi sangre y mis huesos.\"</div>\n<p>初始行动力：8\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：8",
      "documented_base_ap": 8
    },
    "卡德霍之颅": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background: #4b0f0f; color:fff;\">Ⅴ 卡德霍之颅</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-5\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/2/21/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5.png/144px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5.png?v=13ymxcl18c5cthei7h7dj5iycc97pfq\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"144\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5.png?v=13ymxcl18c5cthei7h7dj5iycc97pfq 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/0/0a/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5-2.png/94px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5-2.png?v=mkb7b4e3ug5tu49rd66fwl9b7h0oulv\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"94\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_5-2.png?v=mkb7b4e3ug5tu49rd66fwl9b7h0oulv 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-5\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">cinco(V)</span><br />卡德霍之颅<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(V)</span> Bolívar</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-5\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>有些伤口不会愈合，有些愤怒不会平息。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">Hay llagas que no conocen la sutura, y furores que el tiempo jamás logra mitigar.</div>\n<p>初始行动力：8\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：8",
      "documented_base_ap": 8
    },
    "源流交汇处": {
      "html": "<div class=\"AKCollapse-title\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg, #196350, #563022, #a72b1c, #c78683, #a72b1c, #563022, #196350);color:#fff\">0 源流交汇处</div>\n<div class=\"AKCollapse-content\">\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-6\" class=\"mw-collapsible raw&#95;title\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/c/c9/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6.png/144px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6.png?v=to3z4zqg3g1h1etlgdzg4cec434qq7g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"144\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6.png?v=to3z4zqg3g1h1etlgdzg4cec434qq7g 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/6/69/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6-2.png/106px-%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6-2.png?v=kvnl8diwm0i3jr9iopvy0ltjxwbpbzq\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"106\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5_7_%E5%B1%82%E7%BA%A7_6-2.png?v=kvnl8diwm0i3jr9iopvy0ltjxwbpbzq 1.5x\" /></span></span></div>\n<div id=\"mw-customcollapsible-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-6\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed raw&#95;title&#95;dec\"><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">cero(O)</span><br />源流交汇处<br /><span style=\"color:#f1cd9f;\">(VI)</span> Bestia Aristócrata</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"raw&#95;title&#95;decode mw-customtoggle-raw&#95;title&#95;decode-6\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-console-line\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span></div>\n<i>兽主们欢迎你的到来。</i><br /><div class=\"serif serif&#95;aa\">Los Soberanos de las Bestias os aguardan para daros la bienvenida.</div>\n<p>初始行动力：5，固定路线排布，<span style=\"background:#fab619; color: #2f2f2f; padding: 0px 5px; border-radius: 2px;\"><span class=\"mdi mdi-eye\" style=\"font-size:;color:;\"></span> 立即揭示</span><b>所有节点</b>\n</p>",
      "initial_ap_paragraph": "初始行动力：5，固定路线排布， 立即揭示所有节点",
      "documented_base_ap": 5
    }
  },
  "portal_return_html": "<p>进入后会获得一定量<b>本层专用</b>的行动力，行动力耗尽后会返回进入该层时所在节点的位置。\n</p>",
  "portal_return_text": "进入后会获得一定量本层专用的行动力，行动力耗尽后会返回进入该层时所在节点的位置。"
}
